// Dialog :
"P712844316" "You freed the Tuatha from the Cabal's spells."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P899091969" "Hmm.  The Cabal seems to be working its spells on all manner of beasts.  What are those sorceresses after?  What could they want? <br><br>It sounds as though your intervention freed the Tuatha not just from their captors, but from their anger as well.  Perhaps there's hope yet for Salamanca, if creatures like the Tuatha can be moved to make peace."
// RandomFameString :
"P623180541" "{HeroName}'s onto something funny with the Cabal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2673094291" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to repel the Fir Bolg from the Misty Wood, {HeroName}.</A>  If we can decrease the violence in Croatoa, maybe we can give its denizens the chance to find peace."
// AcceptString :
"P75019866" "Repel the Fir Bolg from the Misty Wood"
// SendOffString :
"P1511690666" "The Fir Bolg and the Tuatha can't seem to resist battle whenever they lay eyes on each other.  If we can keep them apart, it'll be better for everyone."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3717444903" "Repel Fir Bolg from Misty Wood"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1959301671" "The wood is still full of Fir Bolg, {HeroName}.  Can't you get rid of a few more?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1227642618" "Our struggle will never cease!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2107729383" "You have decreased the number of Fir Bolg in the Misty Wood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4217936955" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  Now that you've created some breathing room between them, maybe the Fir Bolg and the Tuatha de Dannan can take some time to consider making peace.  At a minimum, there'll be less violence around here for a while."
// RandomFameString :
"P3803111810" "The Fir Bolg are no match for {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P418818172" "Have you seen those strange, small creatures roaming around the Misty Wood?  The Red Caps?  They're a terrible lot.  Every time one of them gets near me, I find myself shaking in my protoplasm. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to find out what they're up to around here.</A>  We already know that they trapped the Fir Bolg in Croatoa, and snared the Tuatha as well when they began to fear that the Fir Bolg would grow too strong to control.  What other evil lurks in their hearts?  I'd like you to tell me."
// AcceptString :
"P3530170499" "Find out what the Red Caps are up to"
// SendOffString :
"P315784303" "The blot those creatures leave on the spirit world is palpable, {HeroName}.  They may look small and harmless.  But they are evil, pure and simple."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P170877711" "Investigate Red Caps in Wood"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2365844479" "We still don't know much about the Red Caps' plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3206599151" "Writhe and die, little Hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1829107306" "One of the Red Caps you defeated grinned and said, 'Kelly be ours eventually!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P9388162" "So.  It is the hatred of these warring creatures that keeps me bound to Croatoa.  Only by bringing peace to the Fir Bolg and the Tuatha can I, and my fellow ghosts, leave Croatoa and go at last to our resting places.  I should have guessed.  Croatoa is a world built on pain and enmity, nurtured by the Red Caps' lust for misery.  To break free of it, we must unravel the fabric of hate."
// RandomFameString :
"P2007373043" "{HeroName} looks shaken.  Perhaps there are things about Croatoa that are better left unknown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1555548817" "I've learned of a battle taking place in the spirit world.  And it's not just any battle.  {HeroName}, this fight has been going on for months!  Ever since the Red Caps drew the Tuatha into Croatoa.  The warriors are locked in combat and they can't break free.  Not until someone destroys the spells holding them in place. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you stop this eternal battle?</A>  I think it may be the first step in freeing myself and the other ghosts from the bonds of Croatoa."
// AcceptString :
"P247832087" "Stop the eternal battle"
// SendOffString :
"P3279145285" "The spell can be broken if you destroy the three Red Cap henges that hold the Fir Bolg and Tuatha to that place.  Be careful, {HeroName}.  The creatures may hate one another most of all, but they won't exactly be thrilled to see you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3285345876" "That battle and the hatred that pours from it is keeping me bound to Croatoa, along with my fellow ghosts.  Please, set us free!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P57366796" "Howls of rage echo in the air."

